    {
      "question": "If I were to use this card's [When Attacking] effect to give a DON!! card to my opponent's \"OP01-078 Boa Hancock\" with no DON!! cards given, and that Boa Hancock then activates its [Blocker] ability, can my opponent use that to activate their Boa Hancock's [On Block] effect?",
